{
  "storage_type": "file",
  "caldav": {
    "server_url": "https://baikal.example.com/dav.php",
    "username": "your-username",
    "password_command": "pass show chronos/caldav",
    "password_env": "",
    "password": ""
  }
}

CREDENTIAL OPTIONS (choose one):

1. password_command - Execute shell command (RECOMMENDED)
   "password_command": "pass show chronos/caldav"
   "password_command": "op read op://Personal/Chronos/password"
   "password_command": "bw get password chronos-caldav"
   "password_command": "security find-generic-password -a chronos -s caldav -w"

2. password_env - Read from environment variable
   "password_env": "CHRONOS_CALDAV_PASSWORD"
   Then: export CHRONOS_CALDAV_PASSWORD="your-password"

3. password - Plain text (NOT RECOMMENDED - insecure!)
   "password": "your-password"
